  - invitation
  synopsis: Ten thousand years to the day since the Event, four strangers each receive
    the same mysterious card. The cards are identical, bearing a single symbol and
    an address. Each person is drawn to the same destination, unaware of the others'
    presence or the weight of their shared fate.
